      "machineHash": "313ba0d1061654bada15346629d5446286d637e5e9c0e145f6625e283b17bab7",
      "machineText": "最後に、長年にわたりプロジェクトを支援してくださった Valerio Tesei 氏に、心より感謝申し上げます。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "Finally, a special thank you to Valerio Tesei for all of his support of the project over the years.",
